\par }\pard \qc \fi-4365\li4365\ri0\nowidctlpar\tx4365\faauto\rin0\lin4365\itap0\pararsid3809103 {\i\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid7892417\charrsid7892417 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Oliver Messel\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0 s design for Act I Scene 3 of
\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0  'Idomeneo\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0  a}{\i\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid3809103 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 t Glyndebourne this year.
\par }\pard \qr \fi-4365\li4365\ri0\nowidctlpar\tx4365\faauto\rin0\lin4365\itap0\pararsid3809103 {\i\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid3809103 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Photo\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0  }{
\i\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid7892417\charrsid7892417 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Angus McBean}{\i\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid7892417 
\par }\pard \ql \fi-4365\li4365\ri0\nowidctlpar\tx4365\faauto\rin0\lin4365\itap0 {\i\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid7892417\charrsid7892417 
\par }\pard \qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\tx360\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7892417 {\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid7892417\charrsid7892417 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
After these explanations it will be understood that the Glyndebourne version keeps faithfully to Moza\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 rt\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0 
s score. But it takes full advantage of a later version, made for a private performance in Vienna in 1786, at the time of Figaro, which contains generous cuts, some precious new pieces, and Mozart\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0 
s own solution of a problem which has puzzled all edito\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 r\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
s : how to replace a male soprano, a castrato, for whom the part of Idamante was originally written. This part which Richard Strauss and Vittorio Gui (in a recent edition have assigned to a female soprano, is unsuitable for this voice, not only on dramati
\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 c\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0  grounds\hich\f0 \emdash \loch\f0 Idamante is not a youngster like Cherubino but a man and a hero\hich\f0 \emdash \loch\f0 
but also for musical reasons. We know from many contemporary descriptions that the castrato voice sounded strikingly different from the female voice, much more strident and metallic.\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0  \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
Another female soprano, added to the two of the original, would result in a noticeable lack of variety in a work with such an abundance of arias. In his Vienna version, Mozart gave the part of Idamante to a tenor, taking the trouble to rearrange the ensem
\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 b\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 \hich\f0 les according to the changed musical situation. He also gave a lead in cutting out the two arias of Arbace, who represents a "confidant,\'94\loch\f0 
 a person whose function is merely to act as a partner in dialogue with one of the protagonists, in order to get over \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 t\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 \hich\f0 
he necessary explanations or exposition of facts. In opera, this old expedient becomes a liability, if the \'93\loch\f0 \hich\f0 confidant\'94\loch\f0 
 has to get his due share of arias, which necessarily are dramatically redundant. Mozart must have felt this weakness, and his two arias,\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0  \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 the most conventional of the opera, can easily be omitted.

\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Can Idomeneo be a success? I think it can, with a sensitive, educated audience. A performance of a work like this is bound to be an experiment, and we are indebted to Glyndebourne for trying it. An\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
d after all, opera, the most extravagant luxury amongst musical institutions, justifies its existence only if it is capable of maintaining alive, say, three dozen of the most accomplished masterpieces of its kind. Idomeneo, to the best of my belief, is on
\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 e\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0  of them. It is time to bring it out of cold storage.}{\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid7892417 
\par }{\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid3809103 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3809103 {\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid3809103 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 [From: }{\i\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid3809103\charrsid3809103 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Opera}
